# Time Series Analysis Report

## Objective

Analyze stock prices over time to detect trends and seasonality.

## Dataset

Apple (AAPL) stock data extracted from the Stock Prices Data Set.

## Methodology

- Data preprocessing
- Date conversion
- Time series visualization
- Seasonal decomposition
- Moving average smoothing

## Results

Three visualizations were created:

- Time Series Plot
- Seasonal Decomposition
- 30-Day Moving Average

## Conclusion

The analysis highlights long-term market trends while smoothing short-term fluctuations. Seasonal decomposition separates the observed data into trend, seasonal, and residual components for better interpretation.